  "_quest_unlocks_readme": [
    "=== QUEST BOOK → MINABLE POOL UNLOCKS ===",
    "The two maps below (quest_unlock_map + quest_task_fallback) are what enable additional",
    "mod namespaces in the random one-block pool when a team completes FTB Quests.",
    "",
    "quest_unlock_map   = quest hex id → mod namespace unlocked for the island team",
    "quest_task_fallback = same quest hex id → task hex id(s) KubeJS listens on (required)",
    "",
    "Complete the quest → that mod's full-cube mineable blocks can roll from the center block.",
    "Manual override: /randomblock poolenable <mod> true",
    "When adding a new unlock: add BOTH map entries. See howtoquest.md § Random block mod unlocks."
  ],

